    "intro": "Inventor is Autodesk's professional tool for 3D mechanical design. Engineers model parts, assemble them, check how they behave and produce the drawings a workshop needs. The catalogue describes it as product design and engineering tools for 3D mechanical design, simulation, visualisation and documentation.\n\nIn India it is bought by machine builders, special-purpose machine and tooling makers, sheet-metal and fabrication shops, engineering consultancies and the design departments of manufacturers. The annual commitment is priced at {{price:autodesk-inventor}} excluding GST, or {{gst:autodesk-inventor}} with 18% GST, per named user, billed yearly.\n\nThis page explains what you are buying, how it compares with Fusion, and how licensing works, so the Inventor price in India makes sense against your actual workflow.",
